mira(mad)(shake): Fine.
//       ^^^^^^^ PIB2005
mira (mad) shake: Fine.
//         ^^^^^ PIB2005

// Must not trigger

mira (mad) leaves the room.
mira (mad) leaves the room: she said.
mira (mad) shake\: Fine.
Breakfast (served) daily: eggs.
mira (mad): Fine.
